The Organic Maps sources are not part of this repository; the build script downloads them from
https://github.com/organicmaps/organicmaps. The icons in gtk-ui/icons/
(converted from the Organic Maps Android app with tools/vector2svg.py) and the UI translations
(data/strings) come from the Organic Maps Project. The Lichen application icon
(packaging/io.github.x_vlad_x.Lichen.svg) is original to this project.
Until 0.1.0-preview5 this project was published as "Organic Maps (GTK)".

